  "display_title": "Beyond Our Marriage Contract",
  "description": "To cover her father’s hospital bills, Ji-Wan agrees to become Tae-Seong's legal wife for three years; a marriage of convenience with one condition, one billion won once the contract ends. Bound by strict terms, the contract prohibits any contact throughout their marriage. Three years pass, and two weeks before the contract expires— Tae-Seong suddenly shows up at her door convinced that Ji-Wan is the love of his life. Now, with her payout on the line and Tae-Seong clinging to a love that never existed, will Ji-Wan still be able to walk away with the life she planned?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
